    <string name="power_intensive">Intensive</string>
    <string name="power_intensive_desc" formatted="false">Everything from Medium, plus:\n• always the dark theme\n• player volume capped at 40%\n• mono only\n• speed, equalizer, bass, treble, subsonic and normalization are locked\n• sound only through a wire or the phone speaker, no Bluetooth\n• the folder is scanned only with the button\n• smaller cover cache and fewer pre-built pages</string>
